From 3ce65bdb2833797798546bc4509b62edf7882c66 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muhammad Afrith D <204439824+dev-afrith@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 09:15:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(seo): make the page indexable and tighten metadata

The prerendered HTML for / held only the loading screen: every section
was mounted client-side after the loader finished, so any crawler that
does not run JavaScript saw an empty document.

- page.tsx: always render nav/main/footer and put the loader on top as an
  overlay. Prerendered HTML goes from 15.6 KB of loader to 72.7 KB with
  every section, project and job title present, and a single <h1>
- Loader: the animated name becomes a <div> so the page keeps one <h1>;
  progress trimmed 1100ms -> 700ms to offset mounting the page at once
- layout.tsx: keywords now cover "Afrith portfolio" / "Muhammad
  portfolio" phrasing, og locale en_IN, and JSON-LD is upgraded from a
  lone Person to a @graph of Person + WebSite + ProfilePage with
  alternateName, sameAs and mainEntityOfPage; JSON-LD escapes "<"
- robots.ts: keeps full crawl access and adds Host + sitemap reference
- sitemap.ts: canonical URL, changefreq/priority, plus the resume PDF
