The grid only listed five projects, so BloodLink, FoodBridge, BizGenie
AI, Notes App and Advanced Calculator never appeared anywhere.

- data: add those five with copy taken from each repo's README (no
  invented claims), plus live demo links where they exist —
  bloodlink.afrith15.workers.dev, foodbridge-afrith.vercel.app and
  calculator-afrith-15.vercel.app
- BloodLink and FoodBridge lead the grid; Notes App and Advanced
  Calculator close it
- public/projects: branded cover art for the five new entries, since
  there were no screenshots to use. Drop a real screenshot at
  public/projects/<id>.png to replace one
- Projects.tsx: intro line now describes the range of work instead of
  counting it
